# Reports — track only the canonical published leaderboards that the Pages
# workflow reads (results.json + leaderboard.md for v1 and v2). Build output
# (index.html), smoke runs, blog/in-house variants and per-episode logs are
# all local-only.
reports/*
!reports/v1/
!reports/v2/
reports/v1/*
reports/v2/*
!reports/v1/benchmark-v1/
!reports/v2/benchmark-v2/
reports/v1/benchmark-v1/*
reports/v2/benchmark-v2/*
!reports/v1/benchmark-v1/results.json
!reports/v1/benchmark-v1/leaderboard.md
!reports/v2/benchmark-v2/results.json
!reports/v2/benchmark-v2/leaderboard.md
